    "Smart: of the accounts with quota to spare, the one whose allowance renews soonest goes first — what it has left would be lost at the reset. The week decides; an account with five hours and no week goes by its five hours, and one whose month its weeks can no longer use up before it renews by its week. One at 90% or more waits until the others can't answer; one resting after a failure goes last.": "Smart: of the accounts with quota to spare, the one whose allowance renews soonest goes first — what it has left would be lost at the reset. The week decides; an account with five hours and no week goes by its five hours, and one whose month its weeks can no longer use up before it renews by its week. One at 90% or more waits until the others can't answer; one resting after a failure goes last.",
    "Until used up": "Until used up",
    "Until used up: one answers everything until its quota is used up; then the next, which keeps them even after the one before renews.": "Until used up: one answers everything until its quota is used up; then the next, which keeps them even after the one before renews.",
    "Use before expiry": "Use before expiry",
    "Use before expiry: the account with the most left per hour until it is lost goes first — at its reset, or, when credits in it expire sooner, by those that expire first; an account with five hours and no week by what its five hours have left per hour. One at 90% or more waits until the others can't answer; a key by the tokens magpie sent it lately.": "Use before expiry: the account with the most left per hour until it is lost goes first — at its reset, or, when credits in it expire sooner, by those that expire first; an account with five hours and no week by what its five hours have left per hour. One at 90% or more waits until the others can't answer; a key by the tokens magpie sent it lately.",
    "Requests spread over the keys or accounts by the weight set beside each: one weighing 3 takes three requests for every one weighing 1 takes, evenly over a few requests. One that fails is passed over while it rests, and the others share its requests; a conversation stays with it as Stays says.": "Requests spread over the keys or accounts by the weight set beside each: one weighing 3 takes three requests for every one weighing 1 takes, evenly over a few requests. One that fails is passed over while it rests, and the others share its requests; a conversation stays with it as Stays says.",
    "Cheapest first": "Cheapest first",
    "Requests go to the member whose model costs least now, by its price a million tokens in and out at this hour — a vendor's peak hours count double where it bills them so, as DeepSeek and Ollama Cloud do — and the cheaper cache read when two cost the same; those that cost the same keep their listed order, and one with no known price goes last.": "Requests go to the member whose model costs least now, by its price a million tokens in and out at this hour — a vendor's peak hours count double where it bills them so, as DeepSeek and Ollama Cloud do — and the cheaper cache read when two cost the same; those that cost the same keep their listed order, and one with no known price goes last.",
    "Free quota by expiry": "Free quota by expiry",
    "Free quota by expiry: the accounts on a free plan, or whose model costs nothing there, go first, the one whose free quota is lost soonest first — at its next reset, or when its credits expire if sooner; once it is used up, the next. A paid one takes requests only when no free one has quota left, the paid as Smart orders them.": "Free quota by expiry: the accounts on a free plan, or whose model costs nothing there, go first, the one whose free quota is lost soonest first — at its next reset, or when its credits expire if sooner; once it is used up, the next. A paid one takes requests only when no free one has quota left, the paid as Smart orders them.",
    "checked in the background, back as soon as it answers": "checked in the background, back as soon as it answers",
    "Every one here has used up its allowance and goes on on its credits, set to spend them only after everything else, so {who}, first in line, goes first.": "Every one here has used up its allowance and goes on on its credits, set to spend them only after everything else, so {who}, first in line, goes first.",
