    "無法儲存打碼設定，請重試。": "無法儲存打碼設定，請重試。",
    "Request {n}: {tokens} of {window} ({pct})": "第 {n} 個請求：{tokens} / {window}（{pct}）",
    "Until used up": "用完再換",
    "Free quota by expiry": "免費額度先到期先用",
    "Free quota by expiry: the accounts on a free plan, or whose model costs nothing there, go first, the one whose free quota is lost soonest first — at its next reset, or when its credits expire if sooner; once it is used up, the next. A paid one takes requests only when no free one has quota left, the paid as Smart orders them.": "免費額度先到期先用：免費方案的帳號，或模型在那裡不花錢的，先用，其中免費額度最先失效的最先——在下次重置時，或其額度包更早到期時；用完了就換下一個。只有所有免費的都沒有額度了，才用付費的，付費的按智慧的順序。",
    "its free quota is lost soonest, in {d}.": "它的免費額度最先失效，還有 {d}。",
    "Free quota by expiry: {who}'s free quota is lost soonest, in {d}, so it's spent first.": "免費額度先到期先用：{who} 的免費額度最先失效，還有 {d}，所以先用它。",
    "it has free quota left, so it's spent before any paid one.": "它還有免費額度，所以先於任何付費的使用。",
    "Free quota by expiry: {who} has free quota left, so it's spent before any paid one.": "免費額度先到期先用：{who} 還有免費額度，所以先於任何付費的使用。",
    "Free quota by expiry: no free one has quota left, so {who}, which is paid for, is next.": "免費額度先到期先用：沒有哪個免費的還有額度，所以接著用付費的 {who}。",
    "Cheapest first": "最便宜優先",
    "Requests go to the member whose model costs least now, by its price a million tokens in and out at this hour — a vendor's peak hours count double where it bills them so, as DeepSeek and Ollama Cloud do — and the cheaper cache read when two cost the same; those that cost the same keep their listed order, and one with no known price goes last.": "請求先發給此刻模型最便宜的成員：看此時每百萬輸入、輸出 token 的價格——按尖峰時段雙倍計價的服務商（如 DeepSeek、Ollama Cloud），尖峰時段按雙倍算——價格相同時看快取讀取哪個便宜；價格相同的按列出的順序，不知道價格的排最後。",
    "{in} in, {out} out a million tokens": "每百萬 token 輸入 {in}、輸出 {out}",
    "it costs least now, even at its peak price — {price}.": "即使按尖峰價格，它此刻也最便宜——{price}。",
    "Cheapest first: {model} costs least on {who} now, even at its peak price — {price}.": "最便宜優先：即使按尖峰價格，{model} 此刻在 {who} 上也最便宜——{price}。",
    "it costs least now — {price}.": "它此刻最便宜——{price}。",
    "Cheapest first: {model} costs least on {who} now — {price}.": "最便宜優先：{model} 此刻在 {who} 上最便宜——{price}。",
    "Cheapest first: no price is known for {model} on {who}, so it goes in its listed place after every one that has a price.": "最便宜優先：不知道 {model} 在 {who} 上的價格，所以它排在所有有價格的後面，按列出的位置。",
    "Requests spread over the keys or accounts by the weight set beside each: one weighing 3 takes three requests for every one weighing 1 takes, evenly over a few requests. One that fails is passed over while it rests, and the others share its requests; a conversation stays with it as Stays says.": "請求按每個金鑰或帳號旁設定的權重分配：權重 3 的每接 3 個請求，權重 1 的接 1 個，幾個請求之內就均勻分開。出錯的在休息期間被跳過，由其他的按各自權重分擔；會話按「會話保持」的設定留在原處。",
    "Use before expiry": "到期前用完",
    "checked in the background, back as soon as it answers": "背景自動偵測，恢復即用",
    "agent": "Agent",
    "requests": "請求",
    "rerouted": "改道",
    "MCP tool": "MCP 工具",
    "Cache keep-alive": "快取保活",
    "Connection check": "連線檢查",
    "Its plugin sent this request itself, so magpie can't split its time": "此請求由外掛自行發出，magpie 無法拆分它的耗時",
    "Claude Code sent this request itself, so magpie can't split its time": "此請求由 Claude Code 自行發出，magpie 無法拆分它的耗時",
    "magpie is masking this request before routing it (Settings › Privacy), so who takes it isn't picked yet.": "magpie 正在為這個請求脫敏（設定 › 隱私），脫敏完才路由，所以還沒選出由誰處理。",
    "magpie hasn't routed this request yet, so who takes it isn't picked yet.": "magpie 還沒開始路由這個請求，所以還沒選出由誰處理。",
    "Nothing took this request: {error}": "沒有誰處理這個請求：{error}",
    "{agent}'s call to magpie's analyze_image MCP tool": "{agent} 對 magpie 的 analyze_image MCP 工具的呼叫",
    "a model that can't see images": "一個看不了圖片的模型",
    "{failed}, the Image recognition model picked in Settings › Models, couldn't describe an image for {whom}: {why}. So magpie had {describer}, the next model it can use that sees, describe it in its place. Not a turn of the conversation.": "{failed} 是在 設定 › 模型 裡選的識圖模型，但它沒能為 {whom} 描述圖片：{why}。所以 magpie 改讓下一個可用的識圖模型 {describer} 來描述。不屬於對話輪次。",
    "{failed}, the model magpie picked to describe images, couldn't describe an image for {whom}: {why}. So magpie had {describer}, the next model it can use that sees, describe it in its place. Not a turn of the conversation.": "{failed} 是 magpie 自動選的識圖模型，但它沒能為 {whom} 描述圖片：{why}。所以 magpie 改讓下一個可用的識圖模型 {describer} 來描述。不屬於對話輪次。",
    "By weight: it's {who}'s share — each account takes requests as its weight says.": "按權重：輪到 {who} 的份額——每個帳號按自己的權重接請求。",
    "{who} is in reserve: {n} of its provider's accounts or keys take requests at once, the first in the list, so it's tried only once they have all failed.": "{who} 是備用的：其供應商同時只用清單中前 {n} 個帳號或 Key，所以只有它們都失敗後才會試它。",
    "{who} answered this conversation last, but it is in reserve while those before it in the list can take requests, so the conversation moves back to them.": "{who} 上次回答了這個對話，但清單中排在它前面的帳號能接請求時它只作備用，所以對話回到它們那裡。",
